use firn/tags

racket is a Tag
racket is a Module
racket is tagged racket

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.racket.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.unstable.racket]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."racket"."enable": enable "Racket programming language"
